### Recommended next read-only verification

Run **against the test database only**, with the FastAPI server still running:

```bash
psql -d omnistat -c "
SELECT u.name AS user_name, u.email, b.name AS business_name, m.role,
       LEFT(u.password_hash, 4) AS hash_prefix
FROM users AS u
JOIN memberships AS m ON m.user_id = u.id
JOIN businesses AS b ON b.id = m.business_id
WHERE u.email = 'omnistat.test.20261013@example.com';
"
```

This report reflects **observed results to date**. Do not mark pending checks as passed until their results have been captured.
